❗️During the day, the Armed Forces of the Russian Federation continued to launch strikes at port and transport infrastructure facilities of Ukraine, involved in the interests of the Armed Forces of Ukraine.

As a result of strikes with high-precision air-based weapons and attack drones, the following infrastructure facilities were damaged:

💥 in Odessa Port (Sea Commercial Port of Odessa State Enterprise), facilities of a logistics centre, where materiels were stored;

💥 in Yuzhny Port (Sea Commercial Yuzhny Port State Enterprise), military cargo storage facilities and POL tanks intended for the Armed Forces of Ukraine;

💥 in Nikolayev Port (Sea Commercial Port of Nikolayev State Enterprise), two tugboats;

💥 at the sea crossing (northeast of Zmeiny island and in the vicinity of Zatoka), a bulk carrier and a dry cargo ship delivering military cargo to Port of Chernomorsk.

🔹Russian Defence Ministry

